# Local CTF working material. Each of these has ZERO commits on any branch
# of this repository, so nothing here has ever been intended as content -
# while `git add -A` would commit all of it, including a 19 MB
# tools/ghidra-dist/ghidra.zip, two 4 MB binaries, a tarball of this repo,
# and challenge flag.txt files. An archive in the history can only be
# removed by rewriting it, so the default is to leave it out; delete the
# line if a directory becomes content.
#
# `knowledge/` is deliberately NOT here: it is committed on branch ctf-v3,
# so the author does keep it.
challenges/
cache/
solved/
tools/
/*.tar.gz
